cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it. This is an INDEPENDENT reconstruction
  of a hybrid-rocket design model built from its governing equations; it does not
  reproduce any specific published result and is not the original authors' code.
title: "Hybrid Rocket Design Model — Independent Reconstruction"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-07-18
